<title>KENYA: SOCCER-KENYA BREWERIES BEAT PORTS AUTHORITY IN CAF CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KENYA BREWERIES BEAT PORTS AUTHORITY IN CAF CUP.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya Breweries beat Ports Authority (Sierra Leone) 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a CAF Cup quarter-final, first leg on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Patrick Dotti Omondi (15).</p>
<p>Attendance - 25,000.</p>
